{"kind":"stack","id":"s-materials","title":"Changes that make new materials","theme":{"background":"#fdf6e3","foreground":"#073642","font":"Arial, sans-serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-q","content":"When you burn a piece of paper, what happens?"},{"type":"button","id":"c1-a","label":"It turns into new materials like ash and smoke","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c1-b","label":"It just gets a little bit lighter in colour","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c1-c","label":"It gets wet and then dries out again","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-t","content":"Irreversible change"},{"type":"text","id":"c2-e","content":"A change that cannot be undone easily. Once the new material forms, you cannot turn it back into the original material."},{"type":"button","id":"c2-next","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"Which pair of materials, when mixed, makes a fizzing gas?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"Vinegar and bicarbonate of soda","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"Water and sugar","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"Sand and water","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-d","label":"Flour and salt","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-q","content":"Vinegar is an acid. What is the fizzing gas made when it reacts with bicarbonate of soda?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"Carbon dioxide","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"Oxygen","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-c","label":"Hydrogen","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-q","content":"You mix vinegar and bicarbonate of soda and a new material forms. What do you do next?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a","label":"Try to pour the new mixture back into the vinegar bottle","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"Write down what you saw and what changed","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-q","content":"The mixture will not go back. You have learned that this change is not easy to reverse."},{"type":"button","id":"c6-next","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-q","content":"Good scientists record their observations. Your notes show the new materials formed."},{"type":"button","id":"c7-next","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-q","content":"Which change is usually irreversible?"},{"type":"button","id":"c8-a","label":"Melting an ice cube","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c8-b","label":"Burning a piece of wood","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c8-c","label":"Dissolving salt in water","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-t","content":"Well done! You finished the materials quiz."},{"type":"text","id":"c9-m","content":"You learned that some changes make new materials, and these changes are hard or impossible to undo."}],"actions":[]}}
